<title>TURKMENISTAN: SOCCER-TURKMENISTAN BEAT VIETNAM IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TURKMENISTAN BEAT VIETNAM IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>ASHGABAT 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkmenistan beat Vietnam 2-1 (halftime 1-0) in a World Cup Asian zone group eight qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Turkmenistan - Redjep Agabayev (40), Valery Galyan (53)</p>
<p>Vietnam - Nguyen Gong Vinh (71)</p>
<p>Attendance: 2,000</p>
</text>
